WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.169
(eerie singing)

00:00:01.169 --> 00:00:02.806
- [Narrator] In Guanajuato, Mexico,

00:00:02.806 --> 00:00:06.723
there is a museum filled
entirely with mummies.

00:00:13.628 --> 00:00:17.295
(speaking foreign language)

00:00:25.388 --> 00:00:27.890
- [Narrator] With 117 bodies in total,

00:00:27.890 --> 00:00:29.858
the museum has the largest collection

00:00:29.858 --> 00:00:33.144
of natural mummies in the world.

00:00:33.144 --> 00:00:34.912
The mummies are the well-preserved remains

00:00:34.912 --> 00:00:37.054
of people who died
during a cholera outbreak

00:00:37.054 --> 00:00:39.054
in Mexico in the 1800's.

00:00:40.872 --> 00:00:44.640
The museum is a haunting and
eerie experience for visitors:

00:00:44.640 --> 00:00:48.140
an opportunity to stare death in the face.

00:01:19.160 --> 00:01:22.077
(electronic chime)

